"1 north 1 east 1 south 1 west walls"
"Towering on all sides, the confining walls seem very tall from this point. 

Providing little glimpse of the outside world, a tall tree or two may be

visible beyond them, but it is hard to tell if it is trees or not,

leaving only the sky as visible freedom.

"
