"towering black statues"
"A few yards southeast of here, two menacing black statues rise from the earth,

crafted with every detail in mind.  Facial features or real detail is hard to

distinguish, but it is obvious that it is present to anyone who has seen

statues before.  At first glance, a soft red glow seems to come from them, and

the first thing you think of is heat, but after a blink or two, the red glow

does not seem to be there, questioning if it ever was.

"
