steeply to the ramparts.  Shallow risers and narrow treads make footing

difficult at best, and nearly impossible to wage a battle on.  A creeping

vine, deep green in color, has begun to lay claim to the abandoned steps,

its claw-like protrusions digging into the nearly non-existent seams of

the walls.

