#17259
"Tower Foyer"
"Hollowed out from a single piece of ivory, burn marks and the dark stains of

dried blood mar the translucent stone, causing it to glow an evil crimson in

the ambient light.  A spiral stairway, chipped and damaged, rises from the

floor, curving around itself sinuously on its journey upward.  There is no

support pillar for the structure, and the railings seem more serpent-like as

they coil through the air, than pieces of cold, hard stone.  A dimly glowing

rune pulses a malignant purple at about chest height.

"
"[Dalthas] reword serpent-like coiling sentence

