#17260
"Courtyard - Before an Ivory Tower"
"Pearlescent ivory walls now stained with soot, rise far into the sky,

seemingly without end from so close to the base.  Not a seam can be seen in

the tower's stone, but scratches and scorch marks reach roughly twenty feet up

its walls.  Above the darkened soot line, the alabaster tower rises

unscathed.  The seamless construction gives the strong impression that the

whole of it was created through a great expenditure of arcane power.  Looking

closer, a dimly glowing rune pulses angrily at about chest level, a malignant

purple.

"
""
