watch two directions at once for approaching enemies.  Though distant, the

eastern and southern roads are visible from here.  Chiseled into the inner

section of the wall, a narrow stairway leads directly down into the courtyard

beside a dark marble building.  A few creeping vines are evident, cresting the

top of the staircase as they attempt to cover the walls in its entirety.  The

vines are yet another reminder that little care has been taken to prevent the

degradation of this once majestic compound.

