"wall"
"Blasted by the heavy hands of gigantic war machines, the stones of the

wall here have been shattered apart.  Great gouges out of the wall have

sent tons of rocks cascading downwards to the ground below.  Rents and

fissures cover the broken wall, their tenders spreading across most of

the surface.  As the icy wind howls from the mountains, it stirs dust and

stone flakes up.  Occasionally the clatter of falling rubble can be

heard, as the wall continues its slow descent into ruin.

"
