"Crushed Gravel Pathway"
"A path of fine, powdery gravel, once cushioning the footfalls of the

Training Ground's residents, meanders parallel to the guildhall walls. 

Sporadic trees, grown well into maturity, soar skyward, at one time

providing shade for those wandering here.  The trees' limbs, no longer

clothed in lush greenery, droop now, their barren branches depressed and

sickly.  The walkway continues northward, and southward the grounds

opening up before the site of an ivory tower.

"
