exquisite fountain that stands within its perimeter.  The fountain captures

the visage of a forest unicorn in mid-rear, crafted in such a way that it is

eerily lifelike.  This narrow circular path and fountain seem untouched by

time, the statue still as perfect as the day it was carved, the gravel still

fresh and clean.  Faint gurgling noises emanate from the fountain as if its

magics still attempted to spout water into the air only to shower down across

the unicorn.

