#17338
"Living Quarters"
"A vast, circular bed dominates the center of the room, topped by an

intricate, metal sigil fashioned to work as a canopy.  Runic engravings,

some of which have been purposefully corrupted, surround the bed in a

mystic circle of power.  At the center of the metallic canopy, there is a

small diamond shaped hole, no doubt it once held some sort of holy object

that was the focal point for some forgotten clerical ritual.  The

personalized sigil that once topped the archway to the south has been

completely obliterated, perhaps due to some superstitious reasoning of

the vandals that damaged the circle to begin with.

"
