"Backyard -- Near a Statue"
"A proud statue stands near here, one of an ethereal-looking figure.  The image

glows and flickers as it dances, hardly looking solid.  The figure is an evil

looking man, dressed in black, and his fiery eyes are very noticeable.  Near

to the statue, on the ground not far from here, is a chisel.  All around the

statue, and even covering the chisel is a fine black powder, probably from the

sculpting of the base of the statue, as it doesn't appear to be carved from

rock.  A branch in the dirt path leads directly to the south, to the white

marble steps of an immense building of dark marble.  Not far to the north is

the outer wall, which looks remarkably intact.

"
