#17368
"Backyard -- Before a Towering Statue"
"The air here is so thick and heavy that it is nearly impossible to

breathe, so permeated is it with evil.  Standing tall and proud to the

south is what can only be described as a statue created out of a sheer

void of matter, Neither metals nor stone can be seen and no evidence of

any mortal hand in its creation.  The void is at once a fathomless depth

and merely two dimensional, though during its imperceptible shift between

these two extremes, it seems to remain constant in its shape of a hooded

man.  Set just below the edge of the hood are a pair of burning orbs that

mimic eyes in this dark creation, leading one to believe, if rumors are

true, that this is a statue of the dreaded Morkith.

"
