remaining space.  The chairs are elegantly upholstered in a midnight blue

damask, and rest unmolested upon the pale carpet.  The legs of the chair are

constructed of the same dark wood that the low tables are, giving the room an

intentional harmony.  The tables are bare, though the mage lights still hover

near their reflective sconces.  Empty alcoves open uselessly unto the south

wall, their treasures long since gone.

"
