#17407
"Decimated Ramparts"
"Extensive damage scarcely covers the description of this section of the

outer wall.  The wall is barely standing and is no longer at its full

original height.  The destruction of the wall does not appear to have

come from any war machine, nor mortal hand.  Instead, the lack of rubble

and the totality of the damage leads one to suspect magic was the culprit. 

The wall itself has crumbled down onto itself to stand at just barely

taller than half its original height.  The once naturally rough stones

have been smoothed down to a glossy sheen, and are covered in a black

soot.  A slight climb to either the north or south will bring you back to

the full height of the outer walls.

"
