"Living Quarters"
"A mosaic of midnight-dark ceramic tiles soars across the ceiling in this room,

creating a night sky.  The stars are set with small facets of crystal,

twinkling in the soft light of the mage globes still hovering near their wall

sconces.  The oaken floor is polished to a high gloss and covered in the

center of the room with a carpet, brightly woven with a pattern of

interlocking squares.  Shelves of dark wood are neatly aligned on the north

wall, while a bed crafted of the same material rests in the corner to the

east.  A polished, ebon statue of a unicorn rests on the shelves, the shadows

cast by the mage lights seemingly clinging to it.  Sitting quietly next to the

neatly-made bed is a small table of the same mahogany.

